>> a := 2.
>> b := 5.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['Hello!'] los-ntawm: ( a ) ntev: b - a).
Tawm sau-ntawv: (['形声字形聲字'] los-ntawm: 2 ntev: 3).
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['形声字形聲字'] qhov-ntev.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['形声a'] qhov-ntev.
